  "process": "Executed rapidly under strong mayoral leadership, involving massive structural demolition, stream excavation, bridge reconstruction, and intensive public communication campaigns.",
  "community": "Widely celebrated by the general public and environmentalists for improving urban aesthetics and air quality, but met with strong resistance and protests from local traditional merchants and manufacturers concerned about business disruption.",
