  "type": "Waterfront Redevelopment / Mixed-use Urban Regeneration",
  "timeline": "1991 (Planning) – Present",
  "agency": "Development Victoria",
  "stakeholders": "Development Victoria, City of Melbourne, developers, residents, businesses, transport agencies",
  "problem": "A former industrial docklands area near Melbourne's city center had become obsolete and underutilized after shipping activities relocated.",
