  "community": "The project attracted investment and visitors but received criticism for lacking neighborhood character and affordable housing.",
  "positive": "Expanded Melbourne's CBD, created employment, improved waterfront access, and stimulated economic growth.",
  "negative": "Weak community identity, expensive housing, and slow population growth during the early years.",
  "mistakes": "The project underestimated the importance of creating an active community rather than simply constructing buildings.",
